  "description": "<div>\n  <p>Find which requested words can be traced through a character grid. A trace starts in any cell and moves up, down, left, or right between consecutive letters; one cell cannot be reused within the same trace. Different words may reuse cells independently.</p>\n  <p>Return each found word <strong>once, sorted in ascending lexicographic order</strong>, even if a word occurs along multiple paths or appears multiple times in the input. Return an empty array if no requested word is present.</p>\n\n  <p><strong>Example 1:</strong></p>\n  <pre><strong>Input:</strong> board = [[&quot;o&quot;,&quot;a&quot;,&quot;a&quot;,&quot;n&quot;],[&quot;e&quot;,&quot;t&quot;,&quot;a&quot;,&quot;e&quot;],[&quot;i&quot;,&quot;h&quot;,&quot;k&quot;,&quot;r&quot;],[&quot;i&quot;,&quot;f&quot;,&quot;l&quot;,&quot;v&quot;]], words = [&quot;oath&quot;,&quot;pea&quot;,&quot;eat&quot;,&quot;rain&quot;]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [&quot;eat&quot;,&quot;oath&quot;]\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> Both eat and oath have adjacent-cell paths; the others do not.</pre>\n\n  <p><strong>Example 2:</strong></p>\n  <pre><strong>Input:</strong> board = [[&quot;a&quot;,&quot;b&quot;],[&quot;c&quot;,&quot;d&quot;]], words = [&quot;ab&quot;,&quot;abc&quot;,&quot;ac&quot;,&quot;bd&quot;]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [&quot;ab&quot;,&quot;ac&quot;,&quot;bd&quot;]\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> abc needs a diagonal step from b to c, which is not allowed.</pre>\n\n  <p><strong>Example 3:</strong></p>\n  <pre><strong>Input:</strong> board = [[&quot;a&quot;]], words = [&quot;a&quot;,&quot;a&quot;,&quot;b&quot;]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [&quot;a&quot;]\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> The single cell matches a only, and duplicate requests do not duplicate output.</pre>\n\n  <p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><code>1 &lt;= board.length, board[0].length &lt;= 12</code>; every row has the same length.</li>\n    <li><code>0 &lt;= words.length &lt;= 100</code>; each word has <code>1</code> to <code>12</code> characters.</li>\n    <li>Board entries and word characters are lowercase English letters; requested words may repeat.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>",
